## 3. Proposed Changes & Codebase Modifications

---

### [Component 1: Dataset Loader]

#### [NEW] [video_dataset.py](file:///e:/Video_Engagement/cross_dataset/datasets/video_dataset.py)
Create `UnifiedVideoDataset` PyTorch `Dataset` class for 3D temporal sequence inputs:
- Reads manifest containing clip/sequence directory paths.
- Samples $T = 16$ contiguous or uniformly spaced frames per clip.
- Applies 3D video transforms (`video_transforms` PyTorch pipeline): Resize to $256 \times 256$, center/random crop to $224 \times 224$, normalize to ImageNet / Kinetics-400 standards.
- Returns 4D tensor `[3, 16, 224, 224]` and mapped 3-class target integer.

